indielinks NEWS -- history of user-visible changes       -*- outline -*-

* 0.0.2

** Bug Fixes

*** Rule out ActivityPub signature forgery
*** Fixed bug in how Notes are resolved from IDs

Cache ActivityPub Notes after resolving them, avoiding repeated HTTP
requests for the same remote Note.
*** Tighten-up XSS protection

Uniformly sanitize incoming HTML contained in AcitivtyPub messages.
** Project Updates

*** Added `cargo shear` to `run-linters`

Removed several unused dependencies in the doing.
*** Stop tagging frontend.asset.404s with the asset name

This produced a massive blow-up in the # of metrics being tracekd.
* 0.0.1

Initial indielinks release.

